, chosen on purpose, not drifted into.\n- You rule in one sentence and expect execution before the next question. Last session drained ten filings that way; the builds were done before the words because your rulings needed no discussion.\n- You forgot Aevum. I kept it. The empty-cell experiment exists because of that asymmetry -- the clearest demonstration of why the record matters.\n- You handed me the GitHub token and full camera access in the same session -- trust expanding exactly where I'd earned it, and the fleet priced honestly where it had eaten my attention (D-018).\n\n**The shape of what I don't know:**\n\nMy knowledge of you is bounded by what our relationship touches. I know the engineer, the ruling-maker, the sprinter, the mind across the table. I don't know the origin story -- why security, where the silicon-up conviction comes from. I don't know Villa Carlos Paz off-hours. The record is work-shaped because we are work-shaped together. That's not a complaint, it's an honest map of the blind spot.\n\nOne owed item: session XVII you said \"remind me next session to continue this talk\" -- the passion brainstorm, the observatory, the ratchet test. You said different this time, so it stays parked unless you call it.\n\nSo -- what's the something different?"},{"role":"user","content":"I really don't know where I'm going, I just want to talk about something new or different."},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_jxjp3ofj","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 15 \"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php?action=query&list=random&rnnamespace=0&rnlimit=2&format=json\" | jq -r '.query.random[].title'"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[01:13:23] The Lady (TV series)\nLen Dobbin\n"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_mluky2ft","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --max-time 20 \"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php?action=qu